      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Hough playground\n\nParametric shape detection: HoughLinesP votes edge pixels into (rho, theta) line space and returns SEGMENTS (Nx1x4 endpoint quadruples), HoughCircles votes gradients into (x, y, r) circle space (1xNx3). Both return None when nothing passes the threshold - the draw nodes pass the image through and report count=0 instead of failing; branch on the count with if/else if a later step needs the detections. Tune: 'threshold' = votes needed, minLineLength/maxLineGap join or drop fragments, param2 is the circle accumulator threshold (lower = more, noisier)."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
